            <span>How long does it take to stitch a suit or sherwani?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Formal suits typically take 7–10 days, safari suits 7–10 days, and wedding sherwanis with embroidery take 14–21 days. We recommend booking wedding orders at least 3 weeks in advance during peak season (October–February).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
