          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Do you provide the fabric, or do I need to bring my own?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Both — we stock certified mill fabrics from Raymond, Siyaram's and Reid &amp; Taylor in-store, and you're also welcome to bring your own fabric for stitching only.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Is a trial fitting included?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, every garment includes one complimentary trial fitting before final stitching to ensure the fit is right.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Where are your stores located?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>We have two locations: our flagship studio in Seawoods, Sector 44, Navi Mumbai (near Seawoods Grand Central), and a branch in Govandi, Mumbai. Both are open all 7 days, 10:30 AM – 9:30 PM.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Do you stitch women's clothing?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
