            <p>No — Fashion Look is an exclusive <strong>men's tailoring atelier</strong>. We specialize entirely in men's bespoke garments: formal suits, sherwanis, pathanis, safari suits, shirts, and trousers. This focus allows us to deliver a higher standard in every garment we make.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>What's the difference between Fashion Look and a big-brand store like Manyavar for a sherwani?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Manyavar sells ready-made and semi-custom sherwanis off a size chart. Fashion Look stitches every sherwani to your individual measurements with a free trial fitting, at a comparable or lower price point, from a shop 5 minutes from Seawoods Grand Central.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
